cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or material, please cite the manuscript and this repository."
type: software
title: "Deployment-oriented early warning of heat-associated production anomalies in commercial dairy farms"
abstract: >
  Source code, figures, and tables accompanying the manuscript:
  "Deployment-oriented early warning of heat-associated production anomalies
  across eight commercial dairy farms" (Computers and Electronics in Agriculture, 2026).
  Implements time-anchored leave-one-site-out validation, cohort-baseline anomaly
  detection with LightGBM, prospective-feature sensitivity analysis, and
  rumination-sensor data fusion across 8 commercial dairy farms in Ningxia, China.

